---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import Recommend from '../components/Recommend.astro';
---
<Layout title="중기청 끝판왕 | 중소기업 청년 전세자금대출 계산기" description="총 전셋값과 본인 자금, 관리비, 월 대출 지급비를 입력해 중기청 전세대출과 추가 대출 이자, 월 지출, 땅에 버리는 돈을 비교하는 계산기입니다." keywords="중기청 계산기, 중소기업 청년 전세자금대출 계산기, 중기청 끝판왕, 전세대출 계산기"><Header /><main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8"><section class="rounded-[28px] bg-slate-950 p-6 text-white sm:p-8"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-300">Housing Loan Calculator</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl">중기청 끝판왕</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">중소기업 청년 전세자금대출과 추가 대출을 함께 계산해 건물별 월 지출과 실제로 사라지는 돈을 비교해보세요.</p></section><section class="mt-6 rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-8"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4"><label class="text-sm font-bold">중기청 비율<input id="ratio" type="number" value="80" class="mt-2 w-24 rounded-xl border p-3" /></label><label class="text-sm font-bold">중기청 금리(연 %)<input id="baseRate" type="number" step="0.01" value="1.2" class="mt-2 w-28 rounded-xl border p-3" /></label><label class="text-sm font-bold">추가대출 금리(연 %)<input id="extraRate" type="number" step="0.01" value="5" class="mt-2 w-28 rounded-xl border p-3" /></label><label class="text-sm font-bold">기간(개월)<input id="months" type="number" value="36" class="mt-2 w-24 rounded-xl border p-3" /></label><p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">기본값은 참고 엑셀의 80%·3년·5% 기준입니다.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">건물 비교 목록</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">월 대출 지급비는 실제 추가대출 월 납입액을 입력하세요.</p></div><button id="add" class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950">건물 추가</button></div><div class="mt-5 overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-[1250px] w-full border-collapse text-right text-sm"><thead class="bg-slate-900 text-white"><tr><th class="p-3 text-left">건물 이름</th><th class="p-3">총 전셋값</th><th class="p-3">관리비</th><th class="p-3">본인 자금</th><th class="p-3">월 대출 지급비</th><th class="p-3">중기청 대출</th><th class="p-3">추가 대출</th><th class="p-3">중기청 총이자</th><th class="p-3">중기청 월이자</th><th class="p-3">추가대출 총이자</th><th class="p-3">추가대출 월이자</th><th class="p-3">총 월 지출</th><th class="p-3">땅에 버리는 돈</th><th class="p-3"></th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">※ 예상 계산용입니다. 실제 대출 가능 여부·금리·한도·상환 방식은 은행과 상품 조건에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다. 중기청 총이자는 참고 이미지처럼 연간 이자 기준으로 계산합니다.</p></section><Recommend /></main><Footer /></Layout>
<script is:inline>
const rows=document.getElementById('rows'), add=document.getElementById('add'), ratio=document.getElementById('ratio'), baseRate=document.getElementById('baseRate'), extraRate=document.getElementById('extraRate'), months=document.getElementById('months'); let data=[{name:'예시 오피스텔',deposit:120000000,fee:80000,own:13000000,payment:350000},{name:'',deposit:'',fee:'',own:'',payment:''}];
const won=(v)=>Number.isFinite(v)?Math.round(v).toLocaleString('ko-KR')+'원':'-';
function totalInterest(principal,annual,term){if(!principal||!annual||!term)return 0;const r=annual/100/12;const pay=principal*r/(1-Math.pow(1+r,-term));return pay*term-principal}
function render(){rows.innerHTML=data.map((x,i)=>{const deposit=Number(x.deposit)||0, fee=Number(x.fee)||0, own=Number(x.own)||0, payment=Number(x.payment)||0, base=deposit*(Number(ratio.value)||0)/100, extra=Math.max(0,deposit-base-own), baseTotal=base*(Number(baseRate.value)||0)/100, baseMonth=baseTotal/12, extraTotal=totalInterest(extra,Number(extraRate.value)||0,Number(months.value)||36), extraMonth=extraTotal/(Number(months.value)||36), monthly=baseMonth+fee+payment, waste=baseMonth+extraMonth; return `<tr class="border-b border-slate-200 align-top"><td class="p-2 text-left"><input data-i="${i}" data-k="name" value="${String(x.name||'').replace(/"/g,'&quot;')}" placeholder="건물 이름" class="w-40 rounded-lg border p-2"/></td><td class="p-2"><input data-i="${i}" data-k="deposit" value="${x.deposit}" type="number" class="w-32 rounded-lg border p-2 text-right"/></td><td class="p-2"><input data-i="${i}" data-k="fee" value="${x.fee}" type="number" class="w-24 rounded-lg border p-2 text-right"/></td><td class="p-2"><input data-i="${i}" data-k="own" value="${x.own}" type="number" class="w-28 rounded-lg border p-2 text-right"/></td><td class="p-2"><input data-i="${i}" data-k="payment" value="${x.payment}" type="number" class="w-28 rounded-lg border p-2 text-right"/></td><td class="p-3 font-bold text-slate-700">${won(base)}</td><td class="p-3 font-bold text-rose-600">${won(extra)}</td><td class="p-3">${won(baseTotal)}</td><td class="p-3">${won(baseMonth)}</td><td class="p-3 text-rose-600">${won(extraTotal)}</td><td class="p-3 text-rose-600">${won(extraMonth)}</td><td class="p-3 font-bold">${won(monthly)}</td><td class="p-3 font-black text-emerald-700">${won(waste)}</td><td class="p-3"><button data-remove="${i}" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-600">삭제</button></td></tr>`}).join(''); rows.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',()=>{data[Number(el.dataset.i)][el.dataset.k]=el.value;render()})); rows.querySelectorAll('[data-remove]').forEach(el=>el.onclick=()=>{data.splice(Number(el.dataset.remove),1);render()})}
add.onclick=()=>{data.push({name:'',deposit:'',fee:'',own:'',payment:''});render()};[ratio,baseRate,extraRate,months].forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('change',render));render();
</script></Layout>
